{
  "id": "ex12b-new-rules",
  "series": "Explainer",
  "variant": "v2: steps every 1-2 s",
  "title": "Football's new rules for 2026/27",
  "layout": "explainer",
  "music": "07-find-a-way.mp3",
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voiceId": "WAppqUXeqDqXjNTaQxG9"
  },
  "sources": [
    "https://www.theifab.com/law-changes/latest/",
    "https://downloads.theifab.com/downloads/changes-to-the-laws-of-the-game-202627?l=en",
    "https://www.concacaf.com/competitions/concacaf/news/concacaf-confirms-implementation-of-the-ifab-2026-27-laws-of-the-game-amendments",
    "https://www.skysports.com/football/news/12098/13549645/world-cup-ifab-confirm-new-var-powers-10-second-substitutions-and-tactical-timeout-ban-in-major-rule-changes"
  ],
  "facts": {
    "countdown": "Law 15/16 2026/27: delaying a throw-in or goal kick -> referee whistles, counts down five seconds with a raised hand; throw-in goes to opponents; late goal kick = corner to opponents",
    "keeper": "2025/26: keeper controlling the ball with hands > 8 s -> corner (Law 17 text)",
    "subs": "10 s to leave when substituted; else substitute cannot enter until first stoppage after one minute",
    "injury": "players treated/assessed on the field or who stop play due to injury leave and stay off one minute (running clock) after the restart; exceptions incl. goalkeeper, injured by an offence punished by YC/RC",
    "var": "VAR may review a red from a clearly wrong second yellow; mistaken identity; wrongly awarded corner (competition option)",
    "mouth": "sending-off for covering mouth when communicating with an opponent in a provocative manner (competition option)",
    "protest": "Law 3/7: fewer than seven players / abandoned match where a team is responsible -> in principle forfeited (approved 28 Apr 2026)"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Football's rules changed this summer. And they're coming for time-wasters.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "hook": true,
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "NEW RULES|2026/27",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 200,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "timewaster",
            "big": "TIME-WASTERS",
            "bigSize": 150,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 7
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Delay a throw-in, and the referee counts down five seconds with a raised hand. Miss it, and it's their throw.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "throwin_wait",
            "label": "DELAY A THROW-IN",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "ref_countdown",
            "big": "5",
            "bigSize": 420,
            "bigY": 1250,
            "w": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_countdown",
            "title": "THROW-IN",
            "word": "5-SECOND COUNTDOWN",
            "w": 8,
            "from": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "THEIR|THROW",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 220,
            "w": 14
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Same with goal kicks. Too slow, and it's a corner to the other team.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "x7_countdown",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "x7_countdown",
            "title": "GOAL KICK",
            "end": "CORNER",
            "w": 0,
            "from": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "corner_given",
            "big": "CORNER",
            "bigSize": 200,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That's on top of last season's eight-second limit for keepers holding the ball.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "keeper_ball",
            "label": "LAST SEASON",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_countdown",
            "title": "KEEPER",
            "end": "CORNER",
            "word": "HOLD IT 8 SECONDS MAX",
            "w": 6,
            "from": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Substitutions. The player coming off now has ten seconds to leave the pitch.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "sub_board",
            "label": "SUBSTITUTIONS",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "x7_countdown",
            "per": 0.2,
            "title": "OFF IN 10",
            "word": "10 SECONDS TO LEAVE",
            "w": 7,
            "from": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Take longer, and your sub waits until the first stoppage after a full minute. You play with ten.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "blue",
        "type": "x7_countdown",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "x7_countdown",
            "per": 0.12,
            "title": "TOO SLOW",
            "end": "WAIT",
            "w": 0,
            "from": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 60,
            "fmt": "{v}",
            "word": "SECONDS, AT LEAST, BEFORE THE SUB",
            "size": 360,
            "w": 8
          },
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "ten_men",
            "big": "10 v 11",
            "bigSize": 230,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 14
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Injuries. Get treated on the pitch, and you must stay off for a minute after the restart.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "physio",
            "label": "INJURIES",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 1,
            "fmt": "{v}",
            "word": "MINUTE OFF THE PITCH",
            "size": 420,
            "w": 9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Unless you're a keeper, or the foul on you got a card.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "teal",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "UNLESS:|KEEPER",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 200,
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "UNLESS:|KEEPER|FOULED + CARD",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 180,
            "w": 6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "VAR gets new powers too. It can now check a red card that came from a clearly wrong second yellow.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "var_screen",
            "label": "NEW VAR POWERS",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "2ND YELLOW|WRONG?",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 200,
            "w": 8
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "RED CARD|OVERTURNED",
            "hi": 0,
            "size": 190,
            "w": 18
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And it can fix mistaken identity, when the wrong player gets booked.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "navy",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "wrong_player",
            "big": "WRONG MAN",
            "bigSize": 170,
            "bigY": 1300,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Competitions can also show a red card for covering your mouth when confronting an opponent.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "mouth_cover",
            "label": "COMPETITION OPTION",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "COVER YOUR|MOUTH = RED",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 190,
            "w": 8
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And walk off in protest? If the game can't go on, your team can lose it by forfeit.",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "red",
        "type": "picture",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "picture",
            "image": "walk_off",
            "label": "WALK OFF IN PROTEST?",
            "w": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "FORFEIT",
            "size": 300,
            "w": 17
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Which rule will change the game most?",
      "scene": {
        "bg": "purple",
        "type": "statement",
        "steps": [
          {
            "type": "statement",
            "text": "WHICH RULE|CHANGES MOST?",
            "hi": 1,
            "size": 180,
            "w": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
